                AutomationProperties.HelpText="Shows bounded candidate identities, counts, statuses, and entry, source, compatibility, assessment, and snapshot digests only; it withholds boilerplate names, locators, versions, capabilities, limitations, evidence, rationale, technology, unit, architecture, repository, template, license, security-policy, personal, local-path, secret, and credential content, and does not establish organizational designation, endorsement, approval, support commitment, compatibility truth or completeness, licensing or security approval, exception or waiver, selection or binding, architecture baseline, implementation readiness or completeness, assignment, execution, acceptance, merge, release, deployment, or action authority."
