                AutomationProperties.HelpText="Shows bounded candidate identities, counts, statuses, and methodology scope, environment, data, ownership, trace, assessment, and snapshot digests only; it withholds Requirement, criterion, method rationale, environment address, test data, owner, evidence, result, personal, local-path, secret, and credential content, and does not establish methodology validity or completeness, environment availability, data fitness, privacy or security approval, owner appointment, test execution or results, evidence or coverage truth, quality, implementation readiness, acceptance, release, deployment, or action authority."
